    "body": "![marmot](https://blossom.primal.net/a67ef9027d71af5862b570fa65ff61f0b7c0e72db3d34918a7bf49918b86bb65.png)\n\nEvery section of the README now has its own hand-crafted SNES 16-bit pixel art marmot illustration, because documentation without marmots is just words. Six sections, six scenes — from encrypted burrows to mountain summits, the colony's story is now told in pixels.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Enhanced documentation with new visual section badges and separators to improve readability and navigation of key content areas.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
